    "name": "Simulator RKM",
    "steam_appid": 3732390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simulation where the player tries on the role of an employee in an organization engaged in controlling and filtering information. The action takes place in a fictional office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen dossiers arrive in front of you every day: assess the risks, make a decision - skip, ban or \u201cliquidate\u201d. Each decision affects the satirical news feed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04441.gif?t=1749061600\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check your I.D.'s and make your fate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fend off any particularly obnoxious guests.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main task of the player is to process the flow of incoming information, analyze it for compliance with the established rules and make decisions about its further fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Your decisions affect the news.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of people walk into your virtual office every day, from regular citizens to potentially dangerous people who could do harm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes different events can happen.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must scrutinize every detail, look for hidden clues, and match a person's data to an ever-changing set of rules and regulations. One wrong decision could cost you your career, and maybe more....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document check: examine photos, dossier and text, look for forbidden markers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skip - the information goes on without interference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ban - the person can no longer share data, but remains alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate - extreme measure: the character disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >News every working day: satirical headlines reflecting the public mood appear at the end of the shift (7 days in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and Easter hints: sarcastic memes, posters, different events every working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And good job!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simulation where the player tries on the role of an employee in an organization engaged in controlling and filtering information. The action takes place in a fictional office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen dossiers arrive in front of you every day: assess the risks, make a decision - skip, ban or \u201cliquidate\u201d. Each decision affects the satirical news feed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/\u0413\u0438\u04441.gif?t=1749061600\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check your I.D.'s and make your fate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/44502b1a133a9cd691e47b6bdd6ec832.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fend off any particularly obnoxious guests.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main task of the player is to process the flow of incoming information, analyze it for compliance with the established rules and make decisions about its further fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/c93458198703130aef9b37b1efd9949b.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Your decisions affect the news.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of people walk into your virtual office every day, from regular citizens to potentially dangerous people who could do harm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/9065e243a5d72b302d98450c0382aa51.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes different events can happen.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must scrutinize every detail, look for hidden clues, and match a person's data to an ever-changing set of rules and regulations. One wrong decision could cost you your career, and maybe more....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document check: examine photos, dossier and text, look for forbidden markers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skip - the information goes on without interference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ban - the person can no longer share data, but remains alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate - extreme measure: the character disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >News every working day: satirical headlines reflecting the public mood appear at the end of the shift (7 days in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and Easter hints: sarcastic memes, posters, different events every working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.poster.avif?t=1749061600\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.webm?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.mp4?t=1749061600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And good job!</i></p>",
